    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="17">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 17</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Be þæm ðe æt þeofe medsceatte nimaþ.] [Ld] Syxte: Gif hwa æt þeofe medsceat nime ⁊ oþres ryht afylle, beo he his weres scyldig.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Sixthly: [we declare] if anyone takes bribes from a thief and [by so doing] frustrates the just claims of another, he shall forfeit his wergeld.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Be ðæm ðe æt þeofe medsceatte nimaþ. Gif hwa æt ðeofe medsceat nime ⁊ oþres rihte afylle, be he his weres scyldig.</ab>
      </div>
